 "utterances": [
  {
   "start": 2.37,
   "end": 7.27,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Morning, everyone. Monday the second of March. Can you hear me over that fan?"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.99,
   "end": 14.59,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Yeah, you sound like you're calling from inside a tumble dryer, but we can hear you."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.96,
   "end": 18.36,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Lovely. Professional start, then."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.46,
   "end": 26.46,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Before we start, whose new car's that in the car park? The blue one taking up most of the county."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.6,
   "end": 32.8,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Not mine. Mine's the one worth less than the tyres on it."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.11,
   "end": 36.21,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "That doesn't narrow it down much."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.23,
   "end": 41.38,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Honestly, you need a banksman to get past it."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.99,
   "end": 45.79,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "It's parked inside the lines, to be fair."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.32,
   "end": 49.47,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Only just. Anyway, very nice. Not jealous at all."
  },
  {
   "start": 50.47,
   "end": 51.87,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Right, motoring section finished?"
  },
  {
   "start": 52.92,
   "end": 56.07,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Please. Some of us haven't even had a coffee."
  },
  {
   "start": 57.85,
   "end": 63.8,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Tomasz Nowak isn't with us today. Everyone else is on, so let's get through the updates first."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.87,
   "end": 69.37,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "I'm here, just on the headset. Bit noisy this end."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.62,
   "end": 73.42,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Yeah, you're dipping in and out a bit."
  },
  {
   "start": 74.47,
   "end": 76.57,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Typical. Worked perfectly before I joined."
  },
  {
   "start": 77.7,
   "end": 86.1,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Callum asked me to pass on his near-miss write-up update: he's been working through it, still on it, and it's going fine so far."
  },
  {
   "start": 88.26,
   "end": 91.76,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Cheers. I can hear you much better than him, anyway."
  },
  {
   "start": 92.91,
   "end": 95.01,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "I heard that bit, funnily enough."
  },
  {
   "start": 95.73,
   "end": 97.83,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Selective headset. We've all had one."
  },
  {
   "start": 99.89,
   "end": 102.34,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Go on, then, what have you got?"
  },
  {
   "start": 104.15,
   "end": 110.1,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Cal also gave me a message about the other near-miss write-up. He's about halfway through that one."
  },
  {
   "start": 112.08,
   "end": 113.28,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Cheers, mate."
  },
  {
   "start": 115.53,
   "end": 116.73,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Right. Quality?"
  },
  {
   "start": 117.93,
   "end": 119.68,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Yep, two bits from me."
  },
  {
   "start": 121.48,
   "end": 127.08,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "That jam clearance and sensor check from before, the one nobody had taken—I'll take that on."
  },
  {
   "start": 129.01,
   "end": 131.11,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Thanks, Pricey. That's with you, then."
  },
  {
   "start": 133.12,
   "end": 135.22,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "And, um, the less cheerful bit."
  },
  {
   "start": 137.12,
   "end": 144.12,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "I can't get any further with inspecting the relief valve for leaks. I need an electrician to isolate it first."
  },
  {
   "start": 144.75,
   "end": 145.95,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Right, understood."
  },
  {
   "start": 146.54,
   "end": 149.69,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Okay, thanks for flagging it. What about you, Haley?"
  },
  {
   "start": 151.17,
   "end": 153.62,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Sorry, was muted. Talking away to myself."
  },
  {
   "start": 154.27,
   "end": 157.07,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "The guarding check's all done. Boxed that off."
  },
  {
   "start": 158.24,
   "end": 159.44,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Good, cheers."
  },
  {
   "start": 160.4,
   "end": 163.2,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "That's me, really. Short and sweet for once."
  },
  {
   "start": 165.64,
   "end": 171.94,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Mine's quick as well: the pressure-drop investigation on the power pack on one is finished, all signed off."
  },
  {
   "start": 174.39,
   "end": 178.59,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Nice. Always good to get a signature at the end of it."
  },
  {
   "start": 179.14,
   "end": 182.64,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "You had something else, didn't you? Sorry, nearly skipped you."
  },
  {
   "start": 183.12,
   "end": 189.77,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Just a bit of history—the inspection on the long belt, I signed that off on Tuesday. That's already done."
  },
  {
   "start": 191.45,
   "end": 192.65,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Ah, yes. Thanks."
  },
  {
   "start": 194.31,
   "end": 196.41,
   "speaker_id": "p02",
   "speaker": "David Whitfield",
   "text": "Tuesday feels about a month ago."
  },
  {
   "start": 198.38,
   "end": 200.48,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Yeah. Right, on the new stuff—"
  },
  {
   "start": 201.59,
   "end": 205.09,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "I'll do the pre-use checks on the trucks next week."
  },
  {
   "start": 206.27,
   "end": 209.77,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Thanks, Cal. Not an emergency but don't let it slip."
  },
  {
   "start": 210.81,
   "end": 212.91,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "Yep, next week. I've got it."
  },
  {
   "start": 213.99,
   "end": 217.14,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "Sorry, I spoke over the end there. Teams lag."
  },
  {
   "start": 218.67,
   "end": 221.47,
   "speaker_id": "p06",
   "speaker": "Callum Reid",
   "text": "No worries. Think everyone got the important bit."
  },
  {
   "start": 222.15,
   "end": 224.6,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "They did. Anything new from stores Jamie?"
  },
  {
   "start": 227.03,
   "end": 232.63,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Yeah so, I'll recalibrate the sensors on the boiler safety valve this afternoon. That's fairly important."
  },
  {
   "start": 233.37,
   "end": 235.82,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Agreed, stores Jamie. This afternoon for that."
  },
  {
   "start": 238.2,
   "end": 239.6,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "Yep, I'll do it."
  },
  {
   "start": 240.33,
   "end": 245.58,
   "speaker_id": "p03",
   "speaker": "Priya Raman",
   "text": "Heard you. You went a bit robotic at the start, but the rest came through."
  },
  {
   "start": 245.95,
   "end": 247.7,
   "speaker_id": "p12",
   "speaker": "Jamie Brennan",
   "text": "That's just my Monday voice."
  },
  {
   "start": 250.15,
   "end": 252.25,
   "speaker_id": "p11",
   "speaker": "Hannah Price",
   "text": "Remarkably similar to your Friday voice."
  },
  {
   "start": 252.83,
   "end": 256.68,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Right, unless anyone's being cut off, that's everything for this morning."
  },
  {
   "start": 257.4,
   "end": 258.6,
   "speaker_id": "p08",
   "speaker": "Marcus Hale",
   "text": "All heard here."
  },
  {
   "start": 260.19,
   "end": 261.59,
   "speaker_id": "p01",
   "speaker": "Sarah Okafor",
   "text": "Lovely. Thanks, everyone. Cheers."
  }
 ],
